WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:02.429
Your learning journey continues.

00:02.769 --> 00:08.084
There is more to discover, more to learn, and more to achieve with WODDI Institute.

00:09.084 --> 00:11.822
Maybe you registered, but never started.

00:12.162 --> 00:14.717
Maybe you began, and life got in the way.

00:15.057 --> 00:17.515
Or maybe you are ready for what comes next.

00:18.315 --> 00:20.922
Wherever you stopped, your place is still here.

00:21.262 --> 00:25.720
Everything you completed is saved, so you simply pick up from your next lesson.

00:26.520 --> 00:30.751
Inside the Course Hub, there are more than a hundred practical courses.

00:31.091 --> 00:39.565
Digital skills, money and business, personal growth, and hands-on trades, in lessons short enough to finish on your phone.

00:40.365 --> 00:44.705
Choose your language, and when you would rather listen than read, tap Listen.

00:45.505 --> 00:48.065
Every module you finish earns Growth Points.

00:48.405 --> 00:54.981
Use them to lift your products to the top of the WODDI Marketplace, or to be featured on our social media pages.

00:55.781 --> 01:00.296
Pass a course's final quiz, and you receive a WODDI Institute certificate.

01:00.636 --> 01:05.029
It carries its own QR code, so anyone can check that it is genuine.

01:05.829 --> 01:10.075
And you can share it in one tap, on WhatsApp, Facebook or LinkedIn.

01:10.874 --> 01:12.383
You are not learning alone.

01:12.723 --> 01:17.817
Your AI Mentor is there whenever you have a question, and our support team is always close by.

01:18.617 --> 01:20.166
So take one step today.

01:20.506 --> 01:26.962
Open WODDI Institute, sign in, and tap Continue. Your next lesson is waiting.

01:27.762 --> 01:33.159
WODDI Institute. Learning for growth. Knowledge for life.
